{
  "claims": [
    {
      "claim_id": "c3",
      "status": "supported",
      "reason": "The evidence contains a model attribution for the derived repayment‑status feature (pay_max) with contribution -0.3853 and direction \"decreases_risk\", matching the statement that the April‑September 2005 repayment status (code 0) reduces risk. It also contains a model attribution for the payment‑to‑bill ratio (pay_ratio) with contribution -0.2862 and direction \"decreases_risk\", and the observed fact records the ratio as 10.7 %, matching the claim that the 10.7 % ratio further reduces risk. No contract rule is violated."
